      "message": "feat(teams): inbound/outbound emoji reactions\n\nAdd and remove Teams reactions through the Bot Framework connector\n(SDK ReactionClient with REST fallback). Processing-status 👀/✅/❌\nare gated by TEAMS_REACTIONS; send_message react/unreact is always on.\nForward inbound messageReaction events to gateway reaction hooks.\n\nSplit from the combined files+reactions branch so files/Graph can land\nas a stacked follow-up.\n\nCo-authored-by: tournierjc <tournierjc@users.noreply.github.com>",
